    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000pfjq](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000pfjq) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 68.437 depth occurred on Feb 23 2025 31km S of Shortland Harbour. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -7.3652 longitude 155.9293. It impacted 3591 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
